( https://albiononline.com/news/living-legacy-2023 )

Adventurer,

With Albion=E2=80=99s sixth anniversary just around the corner, the *celebr=
ations* ( https://albiononline.com/news/sixth-anniversary-sale ) continue. =
*Decorations* adorn the cities, adventurers enjoy *birthday cake,* and stat=
ues from Conquerors=E2=80=99 Hall roam the open world. For the next two wee=
ks, fight these living monuments to Albion=E2=80=99s history in the *Living=
 Legacy* event!

We've marked the occasion with a brand-new trailer:

( https://youtu.be/0GkBBVDtqIo )

In addition to last year=E2=80=99s enemies, this year features statues from=
 Seasons 16, 17, and 18. All these monuments can be found roaming any *Tier=
 5 or higher* zone, carrying valuable loot like *Sixth Anniversary Riding H=
orse Skins* , *Anniversary Cake* which grants a temporary Fame buff, a fire=
work-firing *Chromacannon* , and more. The statues come in three sizes and =
strengths - and of course, the fiercer the foe, the greater the rewards. Fo=
r details, check out the *patchnotes* ( https://albiononline.com/changelog/=
living-legacy-2023 ).

Furthermore, any character who logs into the game during the event receives=
 a special *Sixth Anniversary Avatar* and *Avatar Ring*. Living Legacy runs=
 until maintenance on *July 26 on Albion East* and *July 27 on Albion West*=
 - so arm up, bring down these malevolent monuments, and earn rewards!

( https://albiononline.com/news/sixth-anniversary-sale )

Anniversary Vanity Sale
-----------------------

The *Anniversary Vanity Sale* is now on, and for the next two weeks you can=
 enjoy discounts of *up to 33%* on a different vanity product *each day* !

These flash deals are exclusive to the *Albion Online Web Shop* ( https://a=
lbiononline.com/shop/featured ) and *in-game store* on the native client, a=
nd will run for 24 hours before a new one begins, so be sure to check in ea=
ch day to make sure you don=E2=80=99t miss out on any!

